Z||000000||87FieroGTx||09-21-2001||03:47 PM|||| I have an 85GT (soon to be a Fastback, no wing) and plan on dropping in a (350hp)Intercooled 3800s/c, 5speed/AOD, full Koni suspension, BIG Brakes, 17"front 18"rear Magnesium wheels with Pirelli Pzero's, Choptop, New euro interior/leather And more.<P> What I was wondering is at this level of mods will an 88 based car perform all that much better than my 85?||||reg||5
